{"id": "EUVD-2026-57793", "enisaUuid": "b804cf86-1f49-35d9-a31b-6d2b1cf9980a", "description": "GitPython versions before 3.1.54 contain an arbitrary file overwrite vulnerability in the Diffable.diff method that fails to validate git options passed through kwargs. Attackers can supply the --output argument via the other parameter or output kwarg to write patch content to attacker-chosen file paths at process privilege level.", "datePublished": "2026-08-13T11:28:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:24:44", "baseScore": 7.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/gitpython-developers/GitPython/security/advisories/GHSA-fjr4-x663-mwxc", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitpython-before-arbitrary-file-overwrite-via-diff"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-73624", "GHSA-6cm2-456v-hrq7", "PYSEC-2026-3995"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.55, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "571cf3be-8ddc-3ac2-af50-6e1b223257b3", "product": {"name": "GitPython", "vendor": {"name": "gitpython-developers"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.1.54"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a7f7a84c-45c4-37e9-a4f7-d87fd3a66be5", "vendor": {"name": "gitpython-developers"}}], "isExploited": false}